{"title":"Meridian Arts Centre:  Canadian Golha Orchestra and Sepideh Raissadat","startsAt":"2026-11-14T19:30:00-05:00","endsAt":"2026-11-14T22:00:00-05:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"In this unforgettable concert, **the Canadian Golha Orchestra joins forces with acclaimed Persian music vocalist Sepideh Raissadat** to present rarely performed masterpieces of Iranian orchestral music. Timeless works by Rouhollah Khaleghi, Ali-Naqi Vaziri, Ali Tajvidi, and other pioneering composers will be brought to life through Raissadat’s velvety voice and the 40-piece orchestra’s expressive interpretation of these intricate and captivating melodies.\n\n***INFO Link here--***\n\nhttps://tolive.com/Event-Details-Page/reference/Canadian-Golha-Orchestra-2026?utm_medium=crosspromo&utm_source=partner&utm_campaign=canadiangolhaorchestra2026&utm_content=torontoisculture\n\nTicket link is below.\n\nInspired by the legacy of the *historic Golha radio orchestra*, the Canadian Golha Orchestra offers a refined interpretation of beloved repertoire by past masters, rooted in the Dastgāh tradition, alongside works by contemporary composers. Together, **the 40-piece orchestra** and Raissadat’s heartfelt artistry promise to immerse audiences in the profound beauty and emotional depth of Persian music.\n\n**More info here:**\n\nhttps://tolive.com/Event-Details-Page/reference/Canadian-Golha-Orchestra-2026\n\n**Ticket link here: ($45-$100)**\n\nhttps://am.ticketmaster.com/tolive/canadiangolhaorchestra-2026\n\n(Play around with the seating map (+) --ensuring you sit where you want!)","venue":{"name":"Meridian Art Center","address":"5040 yonge street, Toronto","lat":43.766052,"lng":-79.414444,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"TORONTO ARTS & CULTURE","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/2/6/a/3/highres_451449891.jpeg"}